EDVR unofficial patch — https://github.com/characterecho-sean/edvr-unofficial-patch
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 characterecho-sean. Full text: tools/EDVR-LICENSE.txt
  - tools/gen_exports.py: EDVR's export thunk generator, copied unchanged; build/gen/edvr_* are its output,
    and src/edloader.cc uses the edvr_* names it generates. tools/gen_exports_from_release.py (edloader's own)
    runs it on the export list of a released EDVR d3d11.dll at build time; no EDVR binary is part of edloader.
  - src/edloader.cc: the proxy loading discipline of EDVR's src/d3d11/d3d11_proxy.cpp (system copy loaded in
    DllMain, the rest on the first export call).

